{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_002_02_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:56b562a3b3f5649620f457db7e950ba77371adf97144c11282cc2792d55d2b4b",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5a94dacb5fddc9504111e7a0bfed41cd7092285eb25fb1e572c0f63055956ddc",
      "text": "向两人撒娇索要的生日",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb02d0e5d7ede0039334011cb80730f92d27c47a6fc5f87028911a70f0e09b54",
      "text": "翔太向冬马和北斗提出请求，\n希望在自己的生日那天能吃到大餐。\n借用事务所的厨房，两人为满怀期待的翔太\n特意准备了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_a:cmd-000019:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b09bcd6e18d66980a219b2c252065efab172f9d4ca056860b35d17112afe537",
      "text": "第2话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_a:cmd-000019:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5a94dacb5fddc9504111e7a0bfed41cd7092285eb25fb1e572c0f63055956ddc",
      "text": "向两人撒娇索要的生日",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_a:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:78306733253078065cfb1a74d3211ed43783f48d30ead0c453689694dbf9f542",
      "text": "……今天的例会就到此结束。\n大家还有其他要联络的事项吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_a:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8de1051222ecf56e18bda98a23c6dee91b80b0efcfc21b488b98a010ab52a8c5",
      "text": "有——！\n不是工作上的事也可以吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_a:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:38e4734be0f7451ce66c0230f64102a6fdba30ab79cb45f2fb46a0db67e4cc55",
      "text": "可以，什么事都行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_a:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:197e50434b1cdea7bb752bf3d1586c41d71e15477e891d9c1feb6453d7c60087",
      "text": "那我就不客气啦。\n……咳咳。冬马君、北斗君。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_a:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:49c7a6bfe2acd00b3efcd927b8a3189581ed244cd38fe709f966c7185b5963f1",
      "text": "怎、怎么了，突然这么一本正经的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_a:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ff5d364b42b208e68c59b2a0015941f6b410fb6edd4edbb004aafbef9c8fad40",
      "text": "看来是很重要的事呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_a:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:97b8eabe04990784dfb88e5827622885a97ce674fd9b327320c39d7afe1a1db7",
      "text": "当然，超级重要的事。\n那个啊，其实……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_a:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:36bf2fcd739667d766d960b7efaae6a8219e713f0fcf6507697ffe29c37f8800",
      "text": "马上就是我的生日啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_a:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7f4e6951f71b40159f8a3d4d79376fc7ac1640e5d85c58846c51a6be83d09536",
      "text": "……嗯，是啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_a:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a67cf35c66f2d1f9a3b99014fd0b39f09d7054b88ac948ea077be6e689cc8ea6",
      "text": "所以说，生日派对的\n大餐就拜托啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_02_1_2_002_02:1_2_002_02_a:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f87c2fa1bec4d70a4b343c36a93ee1b41590dcd6cf1a33b85ec5298742420da",
      "text": "你这家伙，真是的还以为是什么事……\n话说，哪有自己主动提的啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
